flowchart TD
    A[Authenticated XRAG interface] --> B[Upload a supported document]
    B --> C[Browser extraction: PDF.js, Mammoth or OCR]
    C --> D[Server validation, limits and SHA-256 deduplication]
    D --> E[Clean and chunk: about 1,100 characters and 140 overlap]
    E --> F[Passage embeddings: Nemotron 3 Embed 1B]
    E --> G[Entity and relation extraction: Nemotron 3 Super]
    G --> H[Schema, quotation and endpoint validation]
    F --> I[D1: metadata, passages, vectors and property graph]
    H --> I
    D --> J[R2: original files]
    I -. optional export .-> K[Neo4j local analysis mirror]

    A --> L[Ask a question and select a retrieval mode]
    L --> M[Authenticated and rate-limited API route]
    M --> N[LangGraph: Retrieve]
    N --> N1[Lexical BM25]
    N --> N2[Vector cosine similarity]
    N --> N3[Graph traversal]
    N1 --> O[Hybrid RRF and bounded evidence selection]
    N2 --> O
    N3 --> O
    O --> P[LangGraph: Generate grounded claims]
    P --> Q[LangGraph: Validate source IDs and quotations]
    Q --> R[Answer, passages, graph paths and warnings]
    R --> S[Source inspection and saved history]
    I --> T[Graph exploration, expert candidates and recommendations]

    U[Deletion request] --> V[Remove R2 original and D1-derived records]
    V --> W[Remove orphan entities and stale query history]
